      "title": "IEEE 802.11: display Partial TSF as microseconds",
      "message": "IEEE 802.11: display Partial TSF as microseconds\n\nTo save space, the value of Partial TSF is stored shifted to the right\nby 10. When displaying to the user, shift it back to the left by 10 and\ndisplay as microseconds.\n",
      "author_name": "Preston Hunt",
      "author_email": "me@prestonhunt.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-04-28T06:30:19.000-07:00",
